 a powerful emotional core about saving humanity, influenced the recent wave of epic science fiction cinema.","direction":"outgoing"},{"source":"aw74","target":"aw78","type":"inspired_by","label":"Inspired By","note":"Directors Phil Lord and Christopher Miller's previous work is noted for its visual inventiveness and ability to blend humor with genuine heart, a style likely to inform their approach to this live-action sci-fi story.","direction":"outgoing"},{"source":"aw74","target":"aw79","type":"inspired_by","label":"Inspired By","note":"A foundational film that portrays first contact not as a conflict, but as an event of profound wonder and discovery, mirroring the optimistic tone of 'Project Hail Mary'.","direction":"outgoing"}],"lineage":{"influenced_by":["aw74","aw74","aw74","aw74","aw74","aw74"],"influences":[]},"stats":{"total_connected":6,"influences_count":5,"influenced_count":1,"filter":"all","vault_count":0,"beyond_count":6}}